	(generator_version "10.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "AQROOT Full Beta v2 mechanical retention point. Oe2.2 mm NON-PLATED through hole for an M2 screw into a moulded enclosure boss. The moulded boss OD is 4.0 mm, so the reserved component-and-copper keep-out is Oe4.5 mm and is carried by a named rule area in the board, not by this footprint. Excluded from the BOM and from the position files - it is a hole, not a part. Created at FBV2-P1-002 (2026-08-24) so that the board no longer references a footprint that has no library copy.")
	(tags "mechanical mounting M2 NPTH boss")
